place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8c5c623e-db0e-11ef-93c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"8c5c623f-db0e-11ef-a1e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"苴","place_name_jianti_auto":"苴","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6240-db0e-11ef-b971-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6241-db0e-11ef-822d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","place_note":"府成都，四川成都","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6242-db0e-11ef-85e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴子城","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴子城","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6243-db0e-11ef-b635-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"合州","place_name_jianti_auto":"合州","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6244-db0e-11ef-aa1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石鏡縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"石镜县","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6245-db0e-11ef-8337-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"墊江縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"垫江县","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6246-db0e-11ef-9aaa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴子","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴子","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6247-db0e-11ef-b857-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"閬中","place_name_jianti_auto":"阆中","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6248-db0e-11ef-b796-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣都","place_name_jianti_auto":"广都","start_index":156,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6249-db0e-11ef-a532-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樊鄕","place_name_jianti_auto":"樊鄕","start_index":158,"tongjian_id":"8c5c624a-db0e-11ef-9836-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"成都","place_name_jianti_auto":"成都","start_index":163,"tongjian_id":"8c5c624b-db0e-11ef-9262-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"巴，春秋巴子之國。蜀，蠶叢、魚鳧之後。華陽國志曰：昔蜀王封其弟於漢中，號曰苴侯，因命其邑曰葭萌。苴侯與巴王爲好。後巴與蜀爲讎，蜀王怒，伐苴侯，苴侯奔巴。巴求救於秦，秦伐蜀，蜀王敗死。秦滅蜀，因遂滅巴、苴，置巴、蜀二郡。史記正義曰：巴子城在合州石鏡縣南五里，故墊江縣也。宋白曰：巴子後理閬中。揚雄蜀本紀曰：蜀王本治廣都樊鄕，徙居成都。華，戶化翻。苴，子余翻。葭，音家。萌，謨耕翻。墊，音疊。閬，音浪。","note_content_jianti_auto":"巴，春秋巴子之国。蜀，蚕丛、鱼凫之后。华阳国志曰：昔蜀王封其弟于汉中，号曰苴侯，因命其邑曰葭萌。苴侯与巴王为好。后巴与蜀为雠，蜀王怒，伐苴侯，苴侯奔巴。巴求救于秦，秦伐蜀，蜀王败死。秦灭蜀，因遂灭巴、苴，置巴、蜀二郡。史记正义曰：巴子城在合州石镜县南五里，故垫江县也。宋白曰：巴子后理阆中。扬雄蜀本纪曰：蜀王本治广都樊鄕，徙居成都。华，户化翻。苴，子余翻。葭，音家。萌，谟耕翻。垫，音叠。阆，音浪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6222-db0e-11ef-890c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陿，與狹同。漢書·趙充國傳·註：山陗而夾水曰陿。","note_content_jianti_auto":"陿，与狭同。汉书·赵充国传·注：山陗而夹水曰陿。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c5c624f-db0e-11ef-adba-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"隴西","place_name_jianti_auto":"陇西","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6252-db0e-11ef-9a7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"說文：猶，玃屬，居山中；聞人聲，豫登木，無人乃下。世謂不決曰猶豫。一說，隴西謂犬子爲猶，犬導人行，忽先忽後，故曰猶豫。又一說，猶豫，犬也，犬爲人行，好先行，卻住以俟其人，百步之間，如是者數四；先者，豫也，遂曰猶豫。猶，夷周翻，又余救翻。玃，厥縛翻。爲，于僞翻。好，呼到翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"说文：犹，玃属，居山中；闻人声，豫登木，无人乃下。世谓不决曰犹豫。一说，陇西谓犬子为犹，犬导人行，忽先忽后，故曰犹豫。又一说，犹豫，犬也，犬为人行，好先行，却住以俟其人，百步之间，如是者数四；先者，豫也，遂曰犹豫。犹，夷周翻，又余救翻。玃，厥缚翻。为，于伪翻。好，呼到翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6251-db0e-11ef-ae69-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"重","people_name_jianti_auto":"重","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6255-db0e-11ef-920c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黎","people_name_jianti_auto":"黎","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6256-db0e-11ef-8501-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周宣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周宣王","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c5c6257-db0e-11ef-9687-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_na